# Global confirm / alert only

Never use `window.confirm`, `window.alert`, or the bare `confirm()` / `alert()` browser dialogs.

Use the shared dialog mounted in `app/app.vue`:

- Yes/No (delete, logout, deallocate): `confirmDialog({ title, message, confirmLabel, variant })`
- Notice / error / success (single OK): `alertDialog({ title, message, variant })`

Do not add per-page DaisyUI confirm/feedback modals for these cases. Keep data UIs (IPAM detail, sync preview, SSH/VNC) as local modals.
